<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY  **17.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    DDF	 DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEAR ONE, STEPS UP TO 4.50 PCT YEAR TWO, 5.50</p>
<p>		PCT YEAR THREE, 6.0 PCT YEAR FOUR AND 6.50 PCT YEAR</p>
<p>		FIVE</p>
<p>	    **CALL 17.APR.98 AT PAR</p>
<p>		INHABERSCHREIBUNG 705</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
